      <div class="dd-tags">
        <span>Caffeine free</span><span>No crash</span><span>27 nutrients</span>
      </div>

      <p class="dd-note">Illustrative &mdash; the pattern this formula is built for, compared with caffeinated energy products as a category. Not measured data. Products shown above are the property of their respective owners and are pictured to illustrate how widely caffeine is sold; no claim is made about any of them.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
